config RT_USING_SYS_STAT
    bool "LEAKCAM: /dev/sysstat, the kernel heap and pages for the STATUS frame"
    depends on RT_USING_MEMHEAP_AS_HEAP
    default n
    help
        One read() of the kernel heap (memheaps) and the page allocator's totals and free bytes: the product
        program reports them to the BL616 in its STATUS frame, which passes them to the server (DESIGN.md 5.3.10).
